blocks.en:
Figure 4: MFVSR demonstrates rich diversity and balanced coverage. Subtitle Statistics: (a) shows a sunburst chart of language coverage across 16 languages, five script groups, and monolingual/bilingual settings;
(e) shows balanced distributions across spatial, temporal, visual style, and language factors, whose full factorial combination forms 24 configurations with 123-126 videos each. Video Statistics: (b) indicates diverse video resolutions across AI-Gen, Real-LQ, and Real-HQ;
(c) presents frame-count distributions with substantial variation in video length;
(d) shows video durations ranging from short clips to sequences longer than 30 seconds;
(f) illustrates video content distributed across nine semantic categories;
(g) presents a word cloud of video captions, covering diverse objects, scenes, attributes, and activities.

blocks.zh:
图4:MFVSR显示了丰富的多样性和均衡的覆盖面。 副标题统计:(a) 显示16种语言、5个脚本组和单一语言/双语环境的语文覆盖日落图;
(e) 显示空间、时间、视觉风格和语言因素的均衡分布,其完全因数组合构成24个配置,每个配置有123-126个视频。 视频统计:(b) 显示AI-Gen、Real-LQ和Real-HQ之间的各种视频分辨率;
(c) 提供帧计数分布,视频长度差别很大;
(d) 显示视频持续时间,从短片段到超过30秒的序列;
(f) 说明传播到九个语义类别的视频内容;
(g) 呈现视频字幕的词云,涵盖各种物体、场景、属性和活动。
